## Basic Redis Distributed Lock

```java
@Component
public class RedisDistributedLock {

    private final StringRedisTemplate redis;

    public boolean tryLock(String lockKey, String token, Duration ttl) {
        // SET key token NX EX ttl — atomic: set only if not exists
        Boolean acquired = redis.opsForValue()
            .setIfAbsent(lockKey, token, ttl);
        return Boolean.TRUE.equals(acquired);
    }

    public void releaseLock(String lockKey, String token) {
        // Lua script: only delete if WE own it (token matches)
        String luaScript = """
            if redis.call('get', KEYS[1]) == ARGV[1] then
                return redis.call('del', KEYS[1])
            else
                return 0
            end
            """;
        redis.execute(
            new DefaultRedisScript<>(luaScript, Long.class),
            List.of(lockKey), token
        );
    }
}

// Usage
@Scheduled(fixedDelay = 60_000)
public void runScheduledJob() {
    String token = UUID.randomUUID().toString();
    String lockKey = "lock:scheduled-job:data-sync";
    boolean locked = distributedLock.tryLock(lockKey, token, Duration.ofMinutes(5));
    if (!locked) {
        log.debug("Another instance holds the lock — skipping");
        return;
    }
    try {
        performDataSync();  // max 5 min job
    } finally {
        distributedLock.releaseLock(lockKey, token);
    }
}
```

## Redisson RLock (Production Grade)

```java
@Bean
public RedissonClient redissonClient() {
    Config config = new Config();
    config.useSingleServer().setAddress("redis://" + redisHost + ":6379");
    return Redisson.create(config);
}

@Service
public class SyncService {
    private final RedissonClient redisson;

    public void syncWithLock() {
        RLock lock = redisson.getLock("sync:data-lock");
        try {
            // Try acquiring, wait max 5s, hold max 10min
            boolean acquired = lock.tryLock(5, 10 * 60, TimeUnit.SECONDS);
            // Watchdog: auto-extends TTL while lock is held
            if (acquired) {
                performLongRunningSync();  // watchdog keeps lock alive
            }
        } catch (InterruptedException e) {
            Thread.currentThread().interrupt();
        } finally {
            if (lock.isHeldByCurrentThread()) {
                lock.unlock();
            }
        }
    }
}
```

